# Description
I added the ability to auto-generate the code templates.

Now you can add `codeTemplate` as object, code template will be generated based on that.
```
export const configuration: ConfiguratorDemoConfiguration = {
  codeTemplate: { component: 'Button', from: '@svelteuidev/core' },
  ...
}
```

If you need more granular control on `codeTemplate` you still can declare function there.
```
const codeTemplate = (props: string) => `
<script>
  import { NativeSelect, Center } from '@svelteuidev/core';

  export let props: any = {};
<\/script>

<div>
  <NativeSelect
    value={1}
    data={[
      { label: 'Option 1', value: 1 },
      { label: 'Option 2', value: 2 },
      { label: 'Option 3', value: 3 }
    ]}${props}
  />
</div>
`;

export const configuration: ConfiguratorDemoConfiguration = {
  codeTemplate,
  ...
};
```

